          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="book" data-book>
        <div class="book__header">
          <button class="book__spine" type="button" data-spine>
            <span>Scoot &mdash; Reimagining micromobility</span>
          </button>
          <a class="btn book__cta" href="https://www.behance.net/gallery/177697167/Scoot-a-micromobility-sharing-app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Behance <Icon name="lucide:arrow-up-right" />
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="book__panel">
          <div class="book__content">
            <Image src={scoot} alt="Scoot app screens" class="book__media" />
            <p class="book__desc">
              A UX design challenge to put micromobility back on its upward
